# Agreement Lifecycle and Provisional Termination

This scope computes key dates related to the lifecycle of the trade agreement, including the denunciation deadline, automatic extension end, and the earliest date for provisional termination.

```catala
declaration scope AgreementLifecycle:
  input initial_agreement_date content date
  input expiry_date content date
  input provisional_start_date content date
  input termination_notice_period content duration
  output denunciation_deadline content date
  output automatic_extension_end content date
  output provisional_termination_date content date
```

## Denunciation Deadline

The agreement must be denounced at least six months before 31 December 1998.

```catala
scope AgreementLifecycle:
  date round down
  definition denunciation_deadline equals |1998-12-31| - 6 month
```

## Automatic Extension End

The application of the provisions is automatically extended for one more year up to 31 December 1999.

```catala
scope AgreementLifecycle:
  definition automatic_extension_end equals |1999-12-31|
```

## Provisional Termination Date

The earliest date on which the de facto application can be terminated is the provisional start date plus the required notice period.

```catala
scope AgreementLifecycle:
  definition provisional_termination_date equals provisional_start_date + termination_notice_period
```